<h2>The procedural history in one view</h2>
<div class="flow">
  <div class="fstep"><strong>July 2022.</strong> Arrest during a forest ambush; FIR under UAPA Sections 10, 13, 18, 20, 39 with IPC, Arms Act and Bombay Police Act offences. Chargesheet follows in January 2023; committal the same month.</div>
